      <title>EchoStar Gains on SpaceX Talks; Lumentum, Marvell Reach Deal | Stock Movers</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-02/echostar-spacex-talks-lumentum-marvell-reach-deal-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">10672f1f05354d435b577fb4</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 16:08:43 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>On this episode of Stock Movers:

- EchoStar (ECHO) is gaining on news Elon Musk's SpaceX is looking to start a wireless service with Echostar.
- Lumentum (LITE) is moving on news Marvell Technology has reached a deal to buy Lumentum at an enterprise value of $115 billion. Lumentum makes lasers and other optical technology for moving enormous amounts of data at high speeds, which underpins the AI boom.
- Apple (AAPL) shares are moving ahead of its earnings report today. Apple shares have climbed 25% from a low in late June, adding roughly $1 trillion in market value, as the company’s steady revenue growth and rising free cash flow have offered a haven for investors. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
